<view class="screen venueScreen {{themeMode==='night'?'sdvNight sdvDeepNight':themeMode==='dusk'?'sdvNight sdvDusk':nightMode?'sdvNight sdvDeepNight':''}} {{fontScale>1.15?'fontLarge':''}} {{viewportWidth<350?'narrowCanvas':''}}" style="--nav-height:{{navHeight}}px;--font-scale:{{fontScale}};--vw:{{viewportWidth}}px;--vh:{{viewportHeight}}px;--safe-bottom:{{safeBottom}}px">
  <nav-bar pinned="{{true}}" title="场地地图" back="{{true}}" />

  <view class="venueHeaderWrap">
    <view class="sdvWoodCard venueControlBar">
      <view class="venueBar">
        <picker class="venuePicker" range="{{venueOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{venueMapIndex}}" bindchange="selectVenueMap">
          <view class="venuePickerValue">
            <text class="venuePickerText">{{venueName}}</text>
            <text class="venuePickerArrow" aria-hidden="true">▾</text>
          </view>
        </picker>
        <text wx:if="{{locationOn}}" class="sdvBadge sdvBadgeGreen">{{simulated?'模拟':'定位中'}}</text>
      </view>
      <view class="gpsInfo" role="status">
        <view class="gpsTopRow">
          <map-icon kind="locate" size="14" color="{{locationOn?'#2c6122':'#5e3616'}}" />
          <text class="venueReference">{{locationOn?(simulated?'模拟定位 · 仅本机':'实时定位 · 仅本机'):'场地导览 · 定位未开启'}}</text>
          <text wx:if="{{locationOn}}" class="gpsMain">{{locationText}}</text>
        </view>
        <text wx:if="{{coordinateText}}" class="gpsCoordinates">{{coordinateText}}</text>
        <text wx:if="{{locationError}}" class="gpsMessage">{{locationError}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="venueFrame">
    <campus-model wx:if="{{modelMode}}" class="campusModel" image-id="{{mapId}}" geo-data="{{geoData}}" layout-key="{{layoutKey}}" bindfallback="useArtMap" />
    <venue-art wx:elif="{{artMode}}" class="venueArt" style="--venue-dock-display:none" image-id="{{mapId}}" src="{{venueSource}}" geo-data="{{geoData}}" osm-reference="{{locationOn}}" auto-tour="{{!locationOn}}" layout-key="{{layoutKey+'-'+locationOn+'-'+hasPosition+'-'+locationError}}" bind:ready="onArtReady" />
    <map wx:else class="guideNativeMap" latitude="{{latitude}}" longitude="{{longitude}}" scale="17" markers="{{markers}}" show-location="{{false}}" enable-rotate="{{false}}" bindregionchange="onNativeRegion" />

    <view class="guideTools">
      <button wx:if="{{locationOn}}" class="guideIcon guideStop" bindtap="stopGps" aria-label="停止本人定位">
        <map-icon kind="close" size="16" color="#8c2c1b" />
        <text class="guideLabel">停定</text>
      </button>
      <button wx:if="{{modelMode}}" class="guideIcon" bindtap="modelReset" aria-label="查看整个3D校园">
        <map-icon kind="map" size="18" color="#332012" />
        <text class="guideLabel">全览</text>
      </button>
      <button wx:if="{{modelMode}}" class="guideIcon" bindtap="tiltModel" aria-label="切换3D俯视与斜视">
        <map-icon kind="cube" size="18" color="#332012" />
        <text class="guideLabel">视角</text>
      </button>
      <button class="guideIcon" wx:if="{{mapId!=='native-gcj02-v1'}}" bindtap="openLayerSheet" disabled="{{layerLoading}}" aria-label="选择地图图层">
        <map-icon kind="layers" size="18" color="#332012" />
        <text class="guideLabel">图层</text>
      </button>
      <button class="guideIcon {{locationOn?'active':''}}" bindtap="locate" aria-label="开启定位或回到本人">
        <map-icon kind="locate" size="18" color="{{locationOn?'#2c6122':'#332012'}}" />
        <text class="guideLabel">定位</text>
      </button>
    </view>
  </view>

  <sdv-modal
    visible="{{layerSheetOpen}}"
    mode="sheet"
    title="地图图层"
    items="{{layerOptions}}"
    cancelText="取消"
    fontScale="{{fontScale}}"
    bindselect="onSelectLayer"
    bindcancel="closeLayerSheet"
    bindclose="closeLayerSheet"
  />
</view>
